{"seq":2,"slug":"collision-particles","title":"粒子碰撞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vfx-particle-systems/simulation/collision-particles","wordCount":1491,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"粒子碰撞\">粒子碰撞</h1><p>一片火星溅到地面应该弹起、一团雨点打到屋檐应该停住、一阵落叶遇到墙应该堆积——没有碰撞，粒子就像活在真空里穿墙而过，再好的 <a href=\"forces-motion\">力与运动</a> 也撑不起&quot;它真的在这个场景里&quot;的可信感。但粒子碰撞和 <a href=\"../../game-physics/\">游戏物理</a> 里那套精确的刚体碰撞是两回事：成千上万个粒子，每个都去和场景几何做精确求交，开销根本承受不起。VFX 的粒子碰撞是一门&quot;用最便宜的近似换取够用的可信度&quot;的手艺，核心是借用渲染管线已经算好的数据，而不是从头做几何求交。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>粒子碰撞按&quot;用什么数据表达场景表面&quot;分成三档，从最廉价到最完整：<strong>深度缓冲碰撞</strong>借用屏幕空间已有的深度图、<strong>有向距离场（SDF）碰撞</strong>用预烘焙的体积场、<strong>解析碰撞</strong>用少量数学定义的平面/球面。它们在精度、覆盖范围、成本上各有取舍：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[粒子位置/速度] --&gt; B{碰撞表达方式}&#10;  B --&gt; C[深度缓冲碰撞&lt;br/&gt;借屏幕空间深度图]&#10;  B --&gt; D[SDF 碰撞&lt;br/&gt;预烘焙体积距离场]&#10;  B --&gt; E[解析碰撞&lt;br/&gt;平面/球/盒 数学定义]&#10;  C --&gt; F[检测穿透 → 计算法线]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[碰撞响应&lt;br/&gt;反弹·衰减·停止·消亡]\">flowchart TD\n  A[粒子位置/速度] --&gt; B{碰撞表达方式}\n  B --&gt; C[深度缓冲碰撞&lt;br/&gt;借屏幕空间深度图]\n  B --&gt; D[SDF 碰撞&lt;br/&gt;预烘焙体积距离场]\n  B --&gt; E[解析碰撞&lt;br/&gt;平面/球/盒 数学定义]\n  C --&gt; F[检测穿透 → 计算法线]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[碰撞响应&lt;br/&gt;反弹·衰减·停止·消亡]</pre><p>下表对比三种方法，它直接决定一个特效该选哪档：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>深度缓冲碰撞</td>\n<td>屏幕空间深度图</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>只知可见表面、屏幕外/背面无信息</td>\n<td>GPU 海量粒子、火花雨雪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDF 碰撞</td>\n<td>预烘焙 3D 距离场</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>烘焙成本、动态物体难</td>\n<td>局部静态场景、烟雾绕障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析碰撞</td>\n<td>平面/球/盒方程</td>\n<td>高（对该形状）</td>\n<td>只能简单形状</td>\n<td>地面、护盾球、简单边界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"深度缓冲碰撞-借渲染的免费午餐\">深度缓冲碰撞：借渲染的免费午餐</h2><p><a href=\"../foundations/gpu-particles-compute\">GPU 粒子与计算着色器</a> 让海量粒子驻留 GPU，但它们要和场景碰撞时，没有现成的场景几何可查。最廉价的解法是<strong>复用深度缓冲</strong>：渲染场景时 GPU 已经为每个屏幕像素算出了最近表面的深度，粒子碰撞直接拿来用——把粒子投影到屏幕，取它所在像素的场景深度，比较粒子深度与场景深度，若粒子钻到了表面之后，就判定为碰撞。表面法线则由深度图做屏幕空间求导（相邻像素深度差）近似重建。</p>\n<p>这套方法的妙处是几乎零额外成本，正适合 GPU 上几十万火花、雨雪。但它的局限来自&quot;它只知道屏幕上看得见的那层表面&quot;：<strong>屏幕外的粒子无信息可碰</strong>、<strong>被遮挡物体背面的厚度未知</strong>（粒子可能&quot;穿过&quot;一面薄墙因为深度图只记了正面）、<strong>视角一转碰撞判断就变</strong>。因此它做的是视觉上&quot;大致挡住&quot;的效果，不追求严密——这正是 VFX 近似哲学的典型体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sdf-碰撞-体积里的距离场\">SDF 碰撞：体积里的距离场</h2><p>当需要粒子稳定地绕过或堆积在某个静态障碍上（烟雾绕柱、积雪靠墙），深度缓冲的视角依赖就不够了。<strong>有向距离场（Signed Distance Field, SDF）</strong> 把场景几何预烘焙成一个 3D 纹理：每个体素存&quot;该点到最近表面的有向距离&quot;，正值在外、负值在内、零在表面。粒子碰撞只需采样自己位置处的 SDF 值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d &gt; r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为粒子半径）：自由，无碰撞；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\le r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>：发生碰撞，且<strong>梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 恰好是表面法线方向</strong>，一次采样同时拿到&quot;撞没撞&quot;和&quot;往哪弹&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hlsl\" data-code=\"float d = sampleSDF(p.pos);            // 采样有向距离&#10;if (d &lt; p.radius) {&#10;  float3 n = normalize(sdfGradient(p.pos));  // 梯度即法线&#10;  p.pos += n * (p.radius - d);          // 推出表面&#10;  p.vel = reflect(p.vel, n) * restitution;   // 反弹+能量衰减&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>float d = sampleSDF(p.pos);            // 采样有向距离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (d &#x3C; p.radius) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  float3 n = normalize(sdfGradient(p.pos));  // 梯度即法线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  p.pos += n * (p.radius - d);          // 推出表面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  p.vel = reflect(p.vel, n) * restitution;   // 反弹+能量衰减</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SDF 提供了深度缓冲没有的体积信息（背面、厚度、屏幕外），代价是烘焙成本和对动态物体的不友好——动的物体要么实时重烘（贵）要么用解析代理近似。Unreal/Unity 都把全局 SDF 作为 GPU 粒子碰撞的一档选项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碰撞响应-弹-衰-停-灭\">碰撞响应：弹、衰、停、灭</h2><p>检测到碰撞只是一半，<strong>响应</strong>决定撞上之后干什么，而 VFX 的响应是高度风格化、不追求物理正确的。最常见的是反射加衰减：把速度沿法线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反射，并乘一个恢复系数（restitution）做能量损失：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}&#x27; = \\big(\\vec{v} - 2(\\vec{v}\\cdot\\vec{n})\\,\\vec{n}\\big)\\cdot e, \\qquad e \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 完全弹性（火花四溅），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 完全吸收（雨点贴地）。常见的风格化响应还有：<strong>停止</strong>（撞地后速度清零、铺成一层，做积雪落叶）、<strong>消亡</strong>（撞到就 kill，做打在墙上即灭的雨滴）、<strong>衍生</strong>（撞击点 spawn 子特效，如火星落地溅起小烟——这是 <a href=\"../vfx-craft/timing-layering\">节奏与分层</a> 里&quot;事件驱动子发射&quot;的来源）。还要处理<strong>切向摩擦</strong>：让沿表面的速度分量也衰减，避免粒子在斜面上无限滑动。注意单帧大位移可能直接跨过薄表面（隧穿），与 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">游戏物理</a> 里连续碰撞检测面对的是同一个问题，但 VFX 通常只做&quot;上一帧在外、这一帧在内&quot;的离散检测，靠限制最大步长缓解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>VFX 粒子碰撞是视觉近似，不做精确几何求交；按场景表达方式分深度缓冲、SDF、解析三档。</li>\n<li>深度缓冲碰撞复用渲染已算好的深度图，近乎免费，适合 GPU 海量粒子，但只知可见表面、有视角依赖。</li>\n<li>SDF 碰撞用预烘焙 3D 距离场，一次采样同得&quot;撞没撞&quot;与法线（梯度），提供体积信息但烘焙贵、惧动态。</li>\n<li>碰撞响应高度风格化：反射加恢复系数做弹、清零做停、kill 做灭、撞击点 spawn 做衍生，外加切向摩擦。</li>\n<li>单帧大位移的隧穿靠限制步长缓解，精确连续检测留给物理 hub。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>碰撞前的运动从何而来：<a href=\"forces-motion\">力与运动</a></li>\n<li>海量粒子驻留 GPU 的前提：<a href=\"../foundations/gpu-particles-compute\">GPU 粒子与计算着色器</a></li>\n<li>撞击点衍生子特效的时序设计：<a href=\"../vfx-craft/timing-layering\">节奏与分层</a></li>\n<li>精确的窄相位碰撞检测：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">游戏物理·窄相位</a></li>\n<li>真正的流体求解（VFX 近似的对照）：<a href=\"../../game-physics/fluid-and-softbody/fluid-simulation\">游戏物理·流体模拟</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"粒子碰撞","id":"粒子碰撞"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"深度缓冲碰撞：借渲染的免费午餐","id":"深度缓冲碰撞-借渲染的免费午餐"},{"level":2,"text":"SDF 碰撞：体积里的距离场","id":"sdf-碰撞-体积里的距离场"},{"level":2,"text":"碰撞响应：弹、衰、停、灭","id":"碰撞响应-弹-衰-停-灭"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"力与运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vfx-particle-systems/simulation/forces-motion"},"next":{"title":"序列帧与动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vfx-particle-systems/simulation/flipbooks-animation"}}